  "slug": "brown-sugar-chicken-brine",
  "name": "Brown Sugar Chicken Brine",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Brown sugar, garlic, soy sauce, and molasses add sweet and savory notes to this quick and easy recipe for a make-ahead chicken brine.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mix salt, brown sugar, garlic, and cayenne pepper together in a large bowl. Pour in water; stir until dissolved. Mix in molasses and soy sauce. Let stand until brine comes to room temperature, about 50 minutes."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 16,
